# 📝 TOEIC Part 5 - Day27

## Question 1

The manager decided _____ the meeting until next week.

A. postpone
B. postponing
C. to postpone
D. postponed

Answer: C

→ decide + to V

---

## Question 2

Employees should avoid _____ personal information with others.

A. share
B. sharing
C. to share
D. shared

Answer: B

→ avoid + -ing

---

## Question 3

The company plans _____ a new branch next year.

A. opening
B. opened
C. to open
D. opens

Answer: C

→ plan + to V

---

## Question 4

She finished _____ the report before lunch.

A. write
B. to write
C. writing
D. wrote

Answer: C

→ finish + -ing

---

## Challenge

The company is considering _____ the deadline.

A. extend
B. extending
C. to extend
D. extended

Answer: B

→ consider + -ing

---

## Key Point

### 동명사

enjoy + -ing
avoid + -ing
finish + -ing
consider + -ing

### to부정사

decide + to V
plan + to V
hope + to V
promise + to V
